{
  "text": "It is important to acknowledge several limitations. Although the study involved the use of a semistructured clinical interview based on DSM-IV criteria  , interrater reliability among helpline staff was not assessed. We recognize the limits of the comparison between the gambling behaviors detected by a semistructured interview with the gamblers identified in the population study through a self-report instrument.",
